/F2 16 Tf (omp-course-lab - Service Specification \(v2\)) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (This document describes the behaviour of the lab service as shipped on `main`.) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (`docs/spec.pdf` is generated from this file by `tools/make_pdf.py` and is the) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (fixture for the PDF-reading exercise; keep the two in sync by re-running the tool.) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F2 12 Tf (1. Overview) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (The lab is a deliberately small order-management backend:) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (- `api/` - a JSON HTTP service \(stdlib `http.server`\) on port 8080 that also) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (  serves the static signup page from `web/`.) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (- `cli/` - an argparse client that reads the same SQLite database directly.) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (- `data/lab.sqlite` - the seeded database \(12 users, 72 orders, 8 months\).) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (Everything is Python 3 standard library. There is no dependency to install.) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F2 12 Tf (2. Data model) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F2 12 Tf (users) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F3 9 Tf (| column     | type    | notes                          |) Tj T*
/F3 9 Tf (|------------|---------|--------------------------------|) Tj T*
/F3 9 Tf (| id         | INTEGER | primary key                    |) Tj T*
/F3 9 Tf (| name       | TEXT    | display name                   |) Tj T*
/F3 9 Tf (| email      | TEXT    | unique, lower-case             |) Tj T*
/F3 9 Tf (| created_at | TEXT    | ISO date `YYYY-MM-DD`          |) Tj T*
/F3 9 Tf (| company    | TEXT    | optional, nullable \(v2\)        |) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F2 12 Tf (orders) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F3 9 Tf (| column      | type    | notes                                              |) Tj T*
/F3 9 Tf (|-------------|---------|----------------------------------------------------|) Tj T*
/F3 9 Tf (| id          | INTEGER | primary key                                        |) Tj T*
/F3 9 Tf (| user_id     | INTEGER | references users.id                                |) Tj T*
/F3 9 Tf (| created_at  | TEXT    | ISO date `YYYY-MM-DD`                              |) Tj T*
/F3 9 Tf (| status      | TEXT    | one of `pending`, `shipped`, `completed`, `cancelled` |) Tj T*
/F3 9 Tf (| total_cents | INTEGER | order total in cents \(never floating point\)        |) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F2 12 Tf (schema_version) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (Single row, `version = 2`. Version 1 databases are upgraded in place by) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (`python3 tools/migrate.py [--db PATH]`, which adds `users.company` and bumps the) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (version; running it again prints `already at version 2` and changes nothing.) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (Fresh databases from `tools/seed_db.py` are created at version 2. The constants) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (derived from the schema live in `generated/schema_info.py`, which is written by) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (`tools/seed_db.py` and must never be edited by hand.) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F2 12 Tf (3. HTTP API) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (All responses are JSON. Errors have the shape `{"error": "<message>"}`.) Tj T*
ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 54 30 Td (omp-course-lab spec - page 1 of 3) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
