/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F2 12 Tf (GET /health) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (Returns `{"status": "ok", "service": "...", "version": "1.0"}`.) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F2 12 Tf (GET /users/<id>) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (Returns the user record plus `company` \(`null` when unset\) and `order_count`,) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (the number of the user's orders whose status is not `cancelled`.) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F3 9 Tf ({"id": 3, "name": "Linus Torvalds", "email": "linus@example.com",) Tj T*
/F3 9 Tf ( "created_at": "2025-09-30", "company": null, "order_count": 5}) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (`404` when the id does not exist.) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F2 12 Tf (GET /users/<id>/orders?status=<status>) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (All of one user's orders, newest first, **without pagination**. Each order has) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (the same shape as in `/orders`. `status` is optional; when present it must be) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (one of the values in `generated.schema_info.STATUSES`, otherwise `400` with an) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (error naming the valid values. `404` when the user does not exist.) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F3 9 Tf ({"user_id": 9, "count": 2,) Tj T*
/F3 9 Tf ( "orders": [{"id": 61, "user_id": 9, "created_at": "2026-04-05",) Tj T*
/F3 9 Tf (             "status": "cancelled", "total_cents": 20299}, ...]}) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F2 12 Tf (GET /orders?month=YYYY-MM&page=N) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (Lists orders newest first, ten per page \(`page` defaults to 1\). `month` is) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (optional; when present it must be `YYYY-MM` \(`400` otherwise\). The response) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (carries `count`, the total number of matching orders across all pages, so that) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (`ceil\(count / page_size\)` is the last page.) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F3 9 Tf ({"month": "2026-03", "page": 1, "page_size": 10, "count": 12,) Tj T*
/F3 9 Tf ( "orders": [{"id": 56, "user_id": 9, "created_at": "2026-03-23",) Tj T*
/F3 9 Tf (             "status": "pending", "total_cents": 338990}, ...]}) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F2 12 Tf (POST /signup) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (Body: `{"name": "...", "email": "...", "company": "..."}` \(`company` optional\).) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (Creates a user and returns `201` with `{"id", "name", "email", "company"}`;) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (`company` is `null` when omitted or blank. Intended behaviour for bad input:) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (- missing or malformed field -> `400`) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (- duplicate email -> `409`) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (- anything else \(database unavailable, bug\) -> `500`) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (The static page at `/` posts to this endpoint \(name, email and the optional) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (company field\) and shows the banner "Welcome aboard!" on success.) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F2 12 Tf (Static files) Tj T*
ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 54 30 Td (omp-course-lab spec - page 2 of 3) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
