/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (`GET /` serves `web/index.html`; other paths fall through to files under `web/`.) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (Paths outside `web/` are rejected with `404`.) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F2 12 Tf (4. Command-line client) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F3 9 Tf (python -m cli users <id>                                  # one user + order count) Tj T*
/F3 9 Tf (python -m cli orders [--month YYYY-MM] [--status STATUS]  # order table, newest first) Tj T*
/F3 9 Tf (python -m cli health                                      # database summary) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (`--month` and `--status` combine with AND. `--status` accepts only the values in) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (`generated.schema_info.STATUSES`; anything else is an argparse usage error) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (\(exit `2`\).) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (Money is always rendered from integer cents as `$12.34`. The CLI exits `0` on) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (success, `1` for "not found", `2` for a `LabError` \(configuration problems\), and) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (argparse's `2` for usage errors.) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F2 12 Tf (5. Configuration) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F3 9 Tf (| variable       | meaning                                   | default             |) Tj T*
/F3 9 Tf (|----------------|-------------------------------------------|---------------------|) Tj T*
/F3 9 Tf (| `DATABASE_URL` | path or `sqlite:///path` to the database  | `data/lab.sqlite`   |) Tj T*
/F3 9 Tf (| `LAB_TOKEN`    | reserved for a future auth exercise       | unset               |) Tj T*
/F3 9 Tf (| `LAB_ISSUE`    | enables the failing test for issue *N*    | unset               |) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (`.env.example` shows the expected shapes. The code never reads `.env` itself.) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F2 12 Tf (6. Testing) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (`python -m unittest discover -s tests` runs the whole suite in well under ten) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (seconds. Tests copy the seeded database to a temporary file and point) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (`DATABASE_URL` at the copy, so they never modify `data/lab.sqlite`.) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (Each seeded issue in `docs/ISSUES.md` has a test that is skipped unless) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (`LAB_ISSUE=<n>` is set; those tests fail on `main` by design and pass once the) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (issue is fixed.) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F2 12 Tf (7. Non-goals) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf () Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (- No authentication, no TLS, no rate limiting.) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (- No ORM, no migrations framework: `tools/migrate.py` is the one hand-written migration.) Tj T*
/F1 10 Tf (- The service is single-node and keeps no state outside SQLite.) Tj T*
ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 54 30 Td (omp-course-lab spec - page 3 of 3) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
